Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《克拉克森的农场》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《第三十六集 更新》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was now late February and winter was very much in retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是二月下旬 冬天已经明显退去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Soon, we would be planting the spring crops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快我们就要用我的高科技新设备 来播种春季作物了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with my new hi-tech equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there was plenty to keep us busy till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在那之前 还有很多事情要忙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}First of all, we had to send some of our sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我们得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on their journey to the kitchen at the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把一部分羊送去酒吧的厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}along with the latest batch of pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有最新的一批猪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These were our original Mules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是我们最初养的杂交羊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Remember the North Country Mules that we had from day one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还记得我们从第一天起就养的 那些北方杂交羊吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are the ones that we lambed that first...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些就是最早那批产过羔的羊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that four years ago? - In Covid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是四年前吗？ - 还是在新冠疫情期间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, sheeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来 羊们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on girls, up, up, up. Pssh! Go on. Pssh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 上去！走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you not find this sad taking these sheep away?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 把这些羊送走 你不难过吗？ - 不难过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cows and sheep,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我并不喜欢把牛和羊送走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't like getting rid of them, I don't like putting them on the lorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我也不喜欢把它们装上卡车 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think any farmer in the world would enjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得没有哪个农民会喜欢… - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}sending their animals off to be killed, thinking "they will be dead tonight,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…把他们的牲畜送去宰杀 想着“它们今晚就死翘翘了”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't like that, or the cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不喜欢那样 牛也一样 但猪会让我特别动感情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I get really emotional about the pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Why? - I just love the pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 为什么？ - 我就是喜欢猪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You know, you love cows. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你知道你喜欢牛吧？ - 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I love pigs, same as that. I just love pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢猪 和喜欢牛一样 我就是喜欢猪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just think the way they taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只会想它们的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once we'd seen the animals off...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把牲畜们送走之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bye, weaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再见 断奶猪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I headed over to The Farmer's Dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我去了农夫的狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which was closed for a couple of days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧要关门几天 以便做一些必要的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that some essential work could be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now what I'm hoping to see here is a forest of white vans
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在希望看到的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and workmen doing jobs, and I'm... Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一片白色货车和工人们 干活的景象 而我…就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Inside, the kitchen was getting a new non-slip floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在室内 厨房正在铺设新的防滑地板…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Gentlemen. - Hello, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 先生们 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a festival of arse cracks in here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天这儿简直是 “屁股缝大赏” 我真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the electricians were trying once again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…电工们也再次试图
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to fix the belligerent power supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}修复那个不听话的供电系统
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are we having a new board? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们要换一整个新电箱？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And no more flickering lights? - Erm... Fingers crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 灯不会再闪了？ - 希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, don't say that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别那么说 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All of this work was being overseen by Alan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有这些工程都由艾伦监督
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who was back in the saddle after his major heart surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他在做了重大心脏手术后 重新回到了工作岗位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's been a long time! Yeah, I'm back, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好久不见了 我回来了 老兄！ - 你回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Alan! You're back! - That's a bit of a man hug, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这算是男人的拥抱 对 - 你看你 就像乔恩邦乔维
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look at you, you're like Jon Bon Jovi. - I have lost a bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我确实瘦了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus. That's a lot of timber gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 这得瘦了多少斤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. A lot of fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 吃了很多水果 新鲜水果… - 感觉怎么样？疼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And how is it? Painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very. I don't wanna show you on camera but it's a nasty cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常疼 我不想在镜头前给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}伤口挺吓人的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Down there? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在下面？那就是…四重搭桥？ - 对 四个 四重搭桥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That was four--- a quadruple? - Quadruple. One had collapsed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一根已经塌陷蜷缩起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and curled itself up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the other four, they were about 85 to 90% blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外四根堵塞了 大概百分之八十五到九十 很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在感觉还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I had a bit of a problem with the lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还好 我的肺有点问题 我失去了百分之三十六的肺功能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I lost 36% of the lungs, all MDF dust and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 都是中密度纤维板的粉尘什么的 - 那是因为你从来不戴口罩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's 'cause you never wear a mask. - None of us do, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们谁都不戴 对吧？问题就在这儿 我们在八九十年代那会儿不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the trouble. We didn't know back in the '80s, '90s.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Not like we do now. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不像现在 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You still don't wear a mask. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你现在还是不戴口罩 - 不戴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我知道 - 所以你的肺废了 而且你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So your lungs are buggered... - 36%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 百分之三十六 - 但现在你的心脏已经康复了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But they've mended your heart now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, they was brilliant. - When I came in for my heart thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 现在很优秀 - 我上次去做心脏检查的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you were two rooms along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就在隔壁两个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, next door. I knew you was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 就在隔壁 我知道你在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm on that "Muntjac" drug, you know the anti-fat one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在吃那种药 叫什么来着 就是那个减肥的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, yeah. - They put me on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们让我吃那个 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And what, are you taking it or injecting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是口服还是打针？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You inject it once a week. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一周打一次 - 嗯 我也在打那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I got that as well. It's only a little baby needle, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}针头很小 对吧？扎进去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:03:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, tiny. You don't even feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 特别小 你根本感觉不到 - 对 挺好的 能抑制食欲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's good. That suppresses your appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, 'cause my cholesterol's what caused mine, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 因为我的问题 就是胆固醇引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah, that's a blockage, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 那就是堵塞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello and welcome to old-people television.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家好 欢迎收看老年人电视节目
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You might be young right now watching this thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在可能还年轻 看着这个节目在想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Well, look at these two old..." One day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“看这两个老家伙…”总有一天… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'll come round and kick you in the balls, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老年病早晚会找上门 狠狠“修理”你的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day, there was more to do at the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 农场里还有更多事情要做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because we'd had some interesting new arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们有一些有趣的新客人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll take this round to where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把这个拿到它们那儿去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Try and get them in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好 - 试着把它们弄进去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hmm... Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的吗？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How else are you gonna... It's easier to transport them in their house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不然你打算怎么弄…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它们待在窝里搬运更容易
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So let's take the staircase out then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们把楼梯拆掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is gonna be awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这会很麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's gonna fuck this up, ain't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他肯定会搞砸的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He can do that now, can't he? Yeah. Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他现在能干这个了 对吧？嗯 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I don't know how. - Thank God for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道怎么弄 - 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The occupants of the new house
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个新家的住户 是我大女儿送我的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had been a present from my eldest daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ten guinea fowl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}十只珍珠鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who'd made the barn where we'd been keeping them smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们把我们养它们的那个谷仓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}absolutely unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}弄得臭得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you got food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有吃的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They are... Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太难闻了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking... It reeks. It is vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 臭死了 真恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Ugh, God, I'm gagging already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 我已经开始犯恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let me get in then. I'll catch them and pass them to you, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我进去 我抓住递给你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got a new house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们有新家了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, little fella!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好啊 小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that finished? - Yeah. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 弄完了吗？ - 对 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done. That's a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Before moving the birds down to their new home in a nearby copse,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在把这些鸟搬到 附近小树林里的新家之前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there was a small Diddly Squat celebration to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一个小小的 迪丽斯库阿特庆祝活动要办
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- G-Dog! - Hello, Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰哥 - 你好 杰里米！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here you go, birthday boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来了 过生日的老家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们没能… - 这太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it will be if I can get it lit. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果能点着的话 确实贴心 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We bought candles that literally will not light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们买的蜡烛居然怎么也点不着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Gerald, I'm so sorry for this. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰拉德 真是太对不起了 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How old are you today? - 78.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你今天多大岁数？ - 78
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We got you, erm, a stripper. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们给你请了个脱衣舞娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, he'll be here in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 他一会儿就到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready? And blow that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗？吹蜡烛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There we go. Perfect. - Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 完美 - 生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Happy birthday, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生日快乐 杰拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Happy birthday, guys. - Happy birthday, G-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 生日快乐 - 生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生日快乐 杰哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... do you know anything about guinea fowl, Gerald?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道珍珠鸡吗 杰拉德？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they get the wattles,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 它们有肉垂 晚上在外面的时候 它们就…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then when you're out at night, they just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}互相往死里叫 所以我觉得它们都是公的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I just think they're all cock birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fine to start with, mental they go after one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一开始还好 后来就疯了似的互相攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the comb. But every one of 'em had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有鸡冠 但每一只都有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of them big long 'uns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那种又大又长的鸡冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It looked so sad, "ah-ah-ah".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来很可怜 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've been told to keep them in that box for five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 有人告诉我们 得把它们关在那个箱子里五天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我看见那只在叫 等它们全叫起来 我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You get all of them, and then, my Christ,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you'll hear 'em down the village no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在村子里都能听得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What it's doing now is... raining on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在的情况是…下雨淋到我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 那我们是开着门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do we leave the door of the house open?
