Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还是关上？ - 我觉得我们应该…它们要跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I think we should... They're escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们现在不在里面 它们在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, they're not in there now, they're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, there's that one there. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那边有一只 你看 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's one on the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}灯上有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit, we haven't got them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操 我们没抓全
