Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you two not count? You morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 里面有两只 对 - 你们俩不会数数吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们两个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once the missing two had been loaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把漏掉的两只装上之后 我小心翼翼地出发去小树林了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I gingerly set off to the copse.
