Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa, God, this is so bloody slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇 天哪 这实在太滑了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ugh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And on the way, I got a bit of a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}路上 我吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that sheep doing in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只羊在干什么…
