Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sheep has got a placenta hanging out of its arse. This is just born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只羊屁股后面挂着胎盘呢 这是刚生的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下
