Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is odd because these are not the EasyCare sheep,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很奇怪 因为这些 不是我们那批易养羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which we know are pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那批我们知道是怀孕的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}these are DifficultCare sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是难养羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which are supposed to be turned into mutton at the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们本应该在酒吧被做成羊肉的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're not supposed to be pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们不应该怀孕的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, how have you got pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 你怎么会怀孕呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How is this... Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这怎么…卡莱布？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but the weird thing is, where has the ram come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但奇怪的是 公羊是从哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To try and get to the bottom of this mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了解开这个谜团
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I called Jeremy, our shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我给我们的牧羊人杰里米打了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bit bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The only thing I can imagine is that before the lambs were weaned off,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我唯一能想到的是 在羔羊断奶之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he's still had his balls and he's got across them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小公羊的蛋蛋还在 然后它就骑了母羊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那现在就是近亲繁殖了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But what we've got is incest going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got incest and you've got... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 既是近亲 还有…没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There is another possibility we ought to consider:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还得考虑另一种可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}virgin birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}处女怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's been documented as something that can occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这种情况是有记录的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I very much doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也许… - 我深表怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是耶稣 - 对 上次他造就出了人
