Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've been expecting the Second Coming, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们一直在期待 第二次降临 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who ever said it was going to be a human? It could be a sheep.
