Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那可能就是耶稣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm telling you, that lamb is called Jesus
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我告诉你 那只羊羔就叫耶稣
