Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Parking attendants, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有停车管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to try and make sure that we didn't have chaos on the A40.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了确保A40公路上 不会乱成一锅粥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, we have this fleet of parking attendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们有一整支停车管理员队伍… - 嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I know, that's £47,000 a month in paying parking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}光是停车管理员 一个月就要花4.7万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I just think that's probably... - So, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得那可能就是… - 所以…好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause the costs are what they are, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为成本就在那儿摆着 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are successful, I mean, in as much as a lot of people come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们确实很成功 至少来的人很多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you do have to empty the cesspit a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 所以你确实得清理化粪池
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you do have to clean the extractors out quite a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你确实得… - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…经常清理油烟机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we do have to worry about the parking otherwise the council will go crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们确实得操心停车的事 否则议会会发疯的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- so we know we have these costs. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以这些成本是必要的 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So another thing I thought, which is controversial,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我想的另一件事可能有点争议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is putting prices up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是涨价
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I've actually gone to the trouble of having a survey
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我刚刚…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of all the other pubs in the area done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我费了好大劲 做了一份 周边其他酒吧的价格调查
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you take a starter, right, meat and bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如说 一份前菜 对吧？肉和面包…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've got chicken liver parfait and sourdough, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们卖鸡肝酱配酸面包 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're cheaper than any other pub in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们比这一带任何一家酒吧都便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We're £9.50. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们卖9.5英镑 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All the others are around £12, £12.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其他的都在12、12.5英镑左右 查尔伯里的公牛酒吧卖15英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£15 at The Bull in Charlbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A steak pie...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一份牛排派… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - We're the cheapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们是最便宜的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are fundamentally cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们从根本上就比别人便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now... this is the interesting thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 有趣的事来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you actually look at the news coverage this place gets,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要是看看这地方 获得的媒体报道 还真不少…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and there's a fair bit of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is from The Express, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是《快报》的报道 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Disgruntled punters have been moaning about the prices of the meals on offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“不满的顾客一直 在抱怨这里菜品的价格
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you want to dine on steak, carrot, mash and cabbage at the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}例如 如果你想在酒吧吃一顿牛排 胡萝卜、土豆泥和卷心菜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it'll cost you 28 quid."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要花28英镑”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, every newspaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 每家报纸 每次提到这家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}every single time this pub is mentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they all say the same thing: "this pub is expensive."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们都说同样的话 “这家酒吧很贵”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Now, the fact is, we're cheaper. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但事实是 我们更便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So here we are with a totally unfounded reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 所以 我们现在面临着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:41.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in The Mirror, The Mail, The Express and all of the newspapers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《镜报》、《每日邮报》、《快报》 以及所有报纸上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- that we're expensive, when we're not. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全不实的名声 他们说我们贵 但其实我们并不贵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bearing in mind our ingredients are costing more than all these other pubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 别忘了 正如你所说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的食材成本比所有其他酒吧都高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 而且我们为食物付出的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, we're paying more for the food than any other pub
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比其他任何酒吧都多 却收得更少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and charging less.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we have to put the prices up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们必须涨价 而且我觉得 我们可以直接把价格涨到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I think we can put the prices up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to what people think we're charging anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人们以为我们收费的那个水平
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm sure we'll turn it round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我相信我们会扭亏为盈的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But we've gotta get a fair return. - Why did you let me buy a pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但我们必须得到公平的回报… - 你当初为什么让我买下这间酒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I tried not to. - I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我曾经试着阻止你 - 我知道你试过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I now have two loss-making businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我现在有两家亏损的企业了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I shall buy a cinema next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来我该买个电影院了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, just when I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 就在我以为 经济情况不能再糟糕的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}things couldn't get more financially bleak,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（杰西史密斯农场商店）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}David the butcher asked for a meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…屠场老板大卫要求见一面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to talk about my rare-breed Sandy and Black pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}聊聊我养的那个稀有品种 桑迪黑猪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at the face. Oh, he's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看这张脸 它那…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I'll take that off so you don't have to look at it any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它切掉 这样你就不用再看它了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That doesn't make it better!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这也没好到哪儿去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you making? Bacon? Or just...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要做什么？培根？还是就…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, in complete truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we can't do much with these apart from sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了做香肠 我们拿这些猪肉 做不了什么别的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh shit, really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll show you what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我给你看看是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you came into the counter
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要是走到柜台前 我们给你端上那个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we kind of gave you that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think you'd be too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得你不会太高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You'd cook it off and it's just like cooking a load of fat, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你把它一下锅煎 就跟煎一大块肥肉似的 明白吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is this yours? - Yeah. That's what we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 这是我们要的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's much bigger in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是这个明显要大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the fat that's going through that 'cause of the breed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但因为这个品种 它里面夹杂的肥肉实在太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I can see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道问题所在了 我不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not going to... Obviously, well, I couldn't argue with you anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 我也没法跟你们争 因为你们是屠夫 我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause you guys are butchers and I'm not,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I can straight away see
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我一眼就能看出来 这基本上就是肥肉 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that this is, you know, primarily fat, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that a characteristic of this breed? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是桑迪黑猪的特点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is why it became a rare breed 'cause people would rather eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是它成为稀有品种的原因 因为人们宁愿吃那个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 那上面的肉更多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's got more meat on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.48,0:15:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All that effort and we've got sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}费了那么大劲 结果我们只能做香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very nice sausages I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要补充一句 是非常好吃的香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, no, delicious I'm sure. Erm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 不 我相信肯定很美味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very expensive sausages...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生产成本非常高的香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's loss-making then that really, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那其实就是在亏钱 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It is a tough game, pig farming. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 养猪这行确实不容易 - 对 不过 换个角度看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Still, look at it this way, at least the pub's losing money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至少酒吧也在亏钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That had been a bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那真是糟糕的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the following morning, things looked rosier...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但第二天早上 情况看起来就光明多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As my high-tech, driverless tractor had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我的高科技无人驾驶拖拉机到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My God, what a fantastic-looking thing this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪 这玩意儿看起来真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The AgBot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it was quite fun seeing it in the NEC,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在国家展览中心看到它挺有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but seeing it on a farm
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但放到农场里 你才会真正意识到它有多…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is when you realise just how...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fantastically futuristic it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多么未来感十足
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's Dutch, isn't it? - Yeah, built in Holland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是荷兰的 对吧？ - 对 荷兰制造
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Diesel engine, generator, two electric motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}柴油发动机 发电机 两个电动机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so the diesel engine powers the generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 所以柴油发动机给发电机供电
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that then powers the two electric motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后发电机再给两个电动机供电
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, so, okay, like a modern-day Royal Navy Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明白了 就像现代皇家海军的驱逐舰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Highly efficient. Don't lose any power in the drivetrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}效率极高 动力传输不会有任何损失
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will, who'd first shown me the AgBot at LAMMA,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}威尔 就是那个在LAMMA展上 最先给我看农业机器人的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.56,0:17:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then explained how it was able to operate on its own
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.56,0:17:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接着解释了它是如何
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in a world full of rules and lawsuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在一个充满规则 和诉讼的世界里自主运行的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The first thing is two GPS receivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先是有两个GPS接收器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So one does the primary navigation, one checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个负责主要导航 另一个负责校验
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause what is the satellite in cars now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在汽车里的卫星定位精度是多少？ 精确到…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They're accurate to within...? - A couple of metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 几米以内 对 - 几米以内？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A couple of metres? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So this is to within... - Two centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而这个精确到… - 两厘米以内
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just under an inch in old-fashioned money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}换算成老单位 不到一英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Next, on the top, the little blue-coloured dome,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来 顶上那个蓝色的小圆顶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a rotating laser beam, for want of a better description.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是一个旋转激光束 姑且这么形容吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- OK. - Scans 30 metres around the AgBot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 扫描农业机器人周围三十米的范围
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, if it detects a... - If it detects something,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果它探测到… - 如果探测到什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it will begin to slow down, and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就会开始减速
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So our dogs, for example, which are not the most well-trained dogs in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后停下 - 所以 比如我们的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if the dog were to run in front of it, it would stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然不是世界上训练得最好的狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - …如果狗跑到它前面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'll slow down and stop, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它会停下吗？ - 减速然后停下 对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If all that fails, if we touch that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果所有这些都失效了 那如果我们碰一下那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the machine will stop dead in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}机器就会立刻在田里完全停下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's a great many safety features?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以有很多安全机制？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Multiple layers of functional safety, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 多层安全保护
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Despite all this "Terminator"-style independence,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管拥有这种终结者式的自主能力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the AgBot can be driven by a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业机器人还是可以人工驾驶的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But for that, you need a gaming controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但为此 你需要一个游戏手柄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To take the break off, one click this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}松开刹车 往这边拨一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了吗？就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So now the machine is live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在机器启动了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前进
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Left and right is on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}左右控制是用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my God, this is so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪 这真是太…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is like the remote-controlled toy you always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像你一直想要的遥控玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:17.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See, all those years on Call of Duty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}玩《使命召唤》的那些年 总算派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}更棒的是 威尔告诉我 一个我五年来一直没学会的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will told me that a job I'd never mastered in five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}hitching things to the back of a tractor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是把农具挂到拖拉机后面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}would now be a doddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在会变得轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nearly there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Yeah, we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 到位了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just go forward a little tiny bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再往前来一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There you go. - I did a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I actually hooked a thing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的把东西挂上去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There you go. - I've done a whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 - 我完成了一整套操作！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well done, proper job. - Me, I did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干得好 真棒 - 是我！我干的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, this is properly raining now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在雨下得挺大的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Should we retire to the office for five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们回办公室躲五分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I think we need a cup of coffee to have a think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我觉得我们需要 喝杯咖啡 好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's at times like this you actually do need a tractor with a cab to be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你确实需要一台有驾驶室的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is the drawback I've just uncovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我刚刚发现的一个缺点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we sheltered from the rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们避雨时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will showed me a bit of ground he'd already mapped out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}威尔给我看了一块他已经测绘过的地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so the AgBot could do a test run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样农业机器人 就可以做一次测试运行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've gotta tell it where to start, where to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们得告诉它从哪里开始 在哪里结束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is where it gets very exciting. You'll like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来就是激动人心的事了 你会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Calculate route".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}计算路线
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（正在构建路线文件…）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Route calculated successfully. - Look at that, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“路线计算成功” 好了 - 你看 出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们可以看到… - 所以这是它要跑多少趟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, so how many passes it's going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你看 你可以看到 它要做什么 在哪里转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And look, you can see what it's gonna do, where it's gonna turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got a nice light-bulb turn there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那里有个漂亮的灯泡形转弯 - 所以它自己算出了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- My God, it's worked out where to turn. - It's worked out where to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在哪里转弯 - 算出了在哪里转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It needs to do a three-point turn. Where it's orange, it's going in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里 它需要做一个三点掉头 橙色的地方表示它要倒车
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太棒了 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is communicating with the machine? - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是在与机器通信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause this is what... I have this thing about driverless cars
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 因为这正是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为无人驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which are all the rage in the world of motoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在汽车界也风靡一时 我对它一直有那种想法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - So you need to go and get groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 所以 你需要去买杂货
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you get your car to go into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你让车自己开进城 它能做到 而且它可以过环岛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which it can do, negotiate roundabouts, negotiate traffic lights,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等红绿灯 找到停车位并停进去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}find a parking space and park in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但然后呢？ 它没法进商店 自己买杂货
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It can't go into the shop and get the groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have to go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须跟着去 既然你都得跟着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And if you go with it... - You may as well drive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那还不如自己开 - 还不如自己开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. It's not difficult to drive a car. It's not tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 开车又不难 又不累
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 那种车毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But this, I can set that going,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这玩意 我可以让它自己去干活
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know I've got three and a half hours to go and do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道我有三个半小时的时间 去做别的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全正确
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is where autonomous driving really makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这才是无人驾驶真正有意义的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.84,0:21:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After the rain had stopped, we climbed into the Range Rover
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.84,0:21:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨停之后 我们上了路虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and from the passenger seat, I piloted the AgBot to the test area.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我坐在副驾驶座上 遥控着农业机器人开到了测试区域
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go. So, implement up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始了 设备升起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, and handbrake off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 松开手刹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:21:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:21:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, while the AgBot was chugging along nicely...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 正当农业机器人 平稳地向前行进时…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.72,0:22:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.72,0:22:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Us two in the cheap seats were struggling a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我们俩坐在车座上的人却有点吃力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡住了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've had a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ready? - Yeah, we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 准备好了吗？ - 好了 可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Steady as we go. - Taking up the slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拉紧拖车绳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, you're having a laugh! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了！ - 你开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Has anyone in the world ever towed themselves out,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这世界上有谁一边开着拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}while driving the vehicle that's doing the towing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一边用车把自己拖出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks to the AgBot, we eventually reached the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多亏了农业机器人 我们终于到了田里…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where it could get on with its day job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它可以在那里干它的正事了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Press and hold button one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按住按钮一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Auto guiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“自动导航” - 所以它现在在自己驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's now driving itself. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's hunting for its start point. - It's hunting for its start point, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它在找它的起点 - 在找起点 对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像只狗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.36,0:23:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just... I'm not turning, I'm not turning that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.36,0:23:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它只是…我没转 我没打方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I am not turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没打方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.96,0:23:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's at its start point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.96,0:23:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它到起点了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Press and hold button two. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按住按钮二 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.56,0:23:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's going. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.28,0:23:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.28,0:23:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.84,0:24:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, it's turning, it's turning. - Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.84,0:24:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它在转弯 - 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.00,0:24:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK, it's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.00,0:24:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 它转完了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's sold itself to me a thousand times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这玩意儿彻底把我征服了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.80,0:24:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is quite unbelievable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.80,0:24:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对我来说 这简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You think you're driving in a straight line but then you look up,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你以为你在开直线 但你抬头看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.64,0:24:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you see a bird, the phone rings, you hit a bump,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.64,0:24:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看见一只鸟 电话响了 或者压到一个坑 你就偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you're off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is perfection. Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那简直完美 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To the centimetre.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}精确到厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The only thing the AgBot couldn't do anything about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业机器人唯一搞不定的就是天气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.24,0:24:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.88,0:25:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which had made the field too wet to cultivate properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.88,0:25:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}田地太湿 没法正常耕作
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.36,0:25:05.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But for now, it had proved its point.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.36,0:25:05.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但眼下 它已经证明了它的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's just stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在让它停下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这种感觉就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's almost like if you'd have arrived at the Battle of Hastings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就好像你带着一架鹞式战斗机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.32,0:25:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with a Harrier Jump Jet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.32,0:25:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}赶到了黑斯廷斯战役现场一样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is how I'm feeling with that now. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在看它就是这种感觉 这…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.60,0:25:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we waited for the soil to dry out,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.60,0:25:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在等待土壤干透的时候 我们还有别的事情要做
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.64,0:25:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there were other jobs to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}like releasing the guinea fowl...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如放飞珍珠鸡…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.00,0:25:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.00,0:25:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}时候到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.80,0:25:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who had now completed their five-day settling-in period.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.80,0:25:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…它们现在已经经过了五天的适应期
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We let them out, but in a very narrow, prescribed area,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把它们放出去 但只让它们 在一个非常狭窄、指定的区域活动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- which is this half of the wood. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也就是这片林子的一半 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.04,0:26:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the thing about guinea fowl is if Mr Fox comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.04,0:26:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而珍珠鸡的好处是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.08,0:26:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果狐狸先生来了… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they'll just scuttle up a tree and Mr Fox can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…它们就会窜到树上 狐狸先生可做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, guinea fowl. Freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 珍珠鸡 自由了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look, here we are. - Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看 出来了 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.88,0:26:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at their little faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.88,0:26:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 去吧 - 你看它们的小脸蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.52,0:26:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of them's gonna go and they're all gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 只要有一只走出来 其他的会跟着 - 对 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.16,0:26:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see that they're trying to pluck up courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看 它们在鼓起勇气 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like when I was seven on a diving board at the swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像我七岁时 站在游泳池的跳板上一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.12,0:26:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.12,0:26:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 -“不 我不行”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, I can't." And you know you're gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道你最终会跳 但你就是觉得“我不行”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you're just like, "Oh, I can't."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.76,0:26:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause in Doncaster, no one could swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.76,0:26:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为在唐卡斯特 没人会游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.16,0:26:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's why I got on the swimming team in Doncaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.16,0:26:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我才进了唐卡斯特的游泳队
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.44,0:26:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause I was the only person that didn't drown in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.44,0:26:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我是唯一一个没在水里淹死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.04,0:26:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, he's gone! He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.04,0:26:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它…它出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He actually fell out, if I'm honest. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它出来了 说实话 它其实是掉出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That was on the diving board being pushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它是掉出来的 - 它像是从跳板被人推下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, now they're all coming. Yeah, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在它们都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.72,0:26:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that's fantastic. Now they can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了 我们现在能看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.64,0:26:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that really makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.64,0:26:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真的让我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.08,0:27:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That actually... That is hurting a pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.08,0:27:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那叫声真刺耳 那声调刺痛了我的耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.88,0:27:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a pitch in that that's hurting my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Our bedroom is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的卧室在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the soundtrack of our lives from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 从今以后 那就是我们生活的背景音乐了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.28,0:27:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I bought my two-year-old granddaughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.28,0:27:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我给我两岁的孙女买…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I went into the shop at Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}圣诞节时 我去了趟商店 问 “你们这儿最吵的玩具是什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.48,0:27:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}said, "Could I have the noisiest toys you have?"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause I knew it would annoy my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我知道那会让我女儿烦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.96,0:27:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and she's repaid me with the nosiest farmyard animals that you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.96,0:27:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果她现在回敬我 送了我最吵的农场动物
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:34.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ Almighty, they're loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷 它们可真吵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（周六 早上七点）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.64,0:27:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Try as they might,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.64,0:27:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 珍珠鸡再怎么努力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the guinea fowl didn't get to spoil our weekend lie-in, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也没能毁掉我们周末的懒觉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.72,0:27:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because we'd already been dragged out of bed by something of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.72,0:27:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们早就被一件紧急事情 从床上拽起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.40,0:28:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hello? - Hi, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.40,0:28:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 喂？ - 嗨 查理？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.28,0:28:03.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.28,0:28:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们遇到麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.04,0:28:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Erm... - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.04,0:28:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（丽莎拍摄）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.96,0:28:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}About a hundred... Well, more than a hundred...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.96,0:28:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 大概一百…不止一百…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.64,0:28:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the word? "Travelling people",
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.64,0:28:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该怎么说 “流动营地的人” 到了酒吧停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.56,0:28:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}have arrived at the pub car park and set up shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.56,0:28:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那里扎营了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.04,0:28:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A hundred what? Vehicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.04,0:28:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一百？你是说车？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.76,0:28:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I haven't gone over there, I just think I'd make things worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.76,0:28:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没过去看 我只是觉得 我过去会让事情更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.04,0:28:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.04,0:28:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但很多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they've got horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们还带着马
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.84,0:28:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An enormous number.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.84,0:28:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}数量巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.32,0:28:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, have they come to camp? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.32,0:28:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 他们是来扎营的？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know. I don't know. I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 我没过去看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.60,0:28:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I haven't been over there. But, I mean, one of our...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.60,0:28:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是 我们的… 你认识那个摄像师本吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.60,0:28:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, you know Ben the cameraman?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - He went over
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 知道 - 他过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and was invited to, forgive the language, fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果被他们很“客气地”请走了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.68,0:28:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He was just... - He's not small.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.68,0:28:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他当时只是… - 他可不是小个子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:28:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, he's a big lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:28:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 他个头挺大的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So now, we need to know what their objectives are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 现在我们需要 知道他们的目的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are they gonna stay? - Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们会留下来吗？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Or are they going to go? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还是会走？ - 什么…我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Whoa. Where are you going? - I've got to get over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇 你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Where? - The pub!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我得过去看看 - 去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.20,0:29:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're not going to the pub. - It's chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.20,0:29:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 酒吧 - 你不能去…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.72,0:29:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are not a diplomat and you have a dicky heart. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.72,0:29:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那边乱套了！ - 你不是外交官
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.64,0:29:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且你心脏还有毛病 下车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.36,0:29:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But... - You're not going, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.36,0:29:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但是… - 你不能去 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.36,0:29:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, let's go. Park that car back there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.36,0:29:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行了 我们走 现在把车倒回去停好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.60,0:29:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.52,0:29:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fortunately, Ben the cameraman refused
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.52,0:29:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 摄像师本
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.64,0:29:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the travellers' kind invitation to "eff off"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.64,0:29:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拒绝了那些流动营地的人 让他“滚蛋”的善意邀请
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and managed to keep filming with his camera and drone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并设法用他的摄像机 和无人机继续拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.08,0:29:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it soon became apparent
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.08,0:29:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快事情就清楚了 这些流动营地的人是把我们的停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.84,0:29:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the travellers were using our car park as a base
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.84,0:29:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当成了基地 在附近的双行道上
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.52,0:29:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for some kind of horse-and-buggy-racing event
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.52,0:29:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}搞某种马车比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.04,0:29:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on the nearby dual carriageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.08,0:29:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are very old by-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.08,0:30:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有很古老的地方法规 你可以在路上遛马
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.28,0:30:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are allowed to exercise your horse on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're totally allowed to do what they're doing here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以他们今天做的事是允许的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The police are all over it. They can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}警察也管不了 不能阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In terms of The Farmer's Dog pub and site,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就“农夫的狗”酒吧和顾客而言 没人能进来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our customers, nobody can get in, it's completely blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全堵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant we had no choice but to sit on our hands and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我们别无选择 只能干等着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Four hours later though,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 四个小时后 他们结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they finished up, went on their way
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上路走了 我们终于可以恢复酒吧营业了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.96,0:30:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we could finally get the pub open.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.24,0:30:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They haven't left much litter, which I was worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们没有留下太多垃圾 我本来还担心这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've done a litter pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们捡过垃圾了 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.96,0:30:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, have you? - They came.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.96,0:30:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}留下了什么 易拉罐之类的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just cans and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.32,0:30:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, syringes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.32,0:30:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 注射器 它们显然是 给马打针用的 我不是专家 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.48,0:30:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They obviously inject the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.24,0:30:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm not an expert but... - Syringes?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.24,0:30:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}注射器？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 操
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.12,0:31:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. And they've given me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.12,0:31:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可不是嘛 他们还给了我这个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.16,0:31:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's for your padlock and the rubbish that they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.16,0:31:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是给你的 赔你的挂锁 和他们留下的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.60,0:31:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And they hope that... - £150?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.60,0:31:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们希望… - 什么 150英镑？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.92,0:31:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.92,0:31:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So they break in... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 他们闯进来… - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.72,0:31:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then pay for the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.72,0:31:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…然后赔偿损失
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, this is something. Yeah, own a pub, it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 这倒是…对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“开个酒吧 会很有趣的” - 我得说…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then have problems like this to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后就遇到这种要处理的问题 - 对 真没想到会遇上这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.52,0:31:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Never expected this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.84,0:31:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of days later, with the fields drying nicely,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.84,0:31:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 田地干得差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we could at last get cracking
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们终于可以开始 我们新的高科技种植计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.84,0:31:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with our new hi-tech crop-planting programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.24,0:31:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, ranging pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.24,0:31:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 标杆 这个会和这个通信
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This will talk to this and we'll record the points as we go around the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们绕着田边走 记录下这些点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Job one involved AgBot Will and I mapping the fields
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项任务是我、威尔 和农业机器人一起测绘田地
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that the AgBot's GPS system would know where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样农业机器人的GPS系统 就能知道它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- "Save this point". - "Save", yeah, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 保存这个点 - 保存 对 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.52,0:32:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So now we go to the next point. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.52,0:32:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那么 现在我们去下一个点 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.60,0:32:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we're staying in line with the hedge, this is straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.60,0:32:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们跟树篱保持平行 这就是直的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.84,0:32:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.84,0:32:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 保存那个点 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:06.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's save that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Save".
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“保存”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, Spitaways is mapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 斯皮特威测绘完毕 - 好了 我们完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we were inputting all the data into the AgBot's brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我们把所有数据 输入农业机器人的大脑时…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.28,0:32:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that... Oh, there it is. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.28,0:32:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（编辑田地：斯皮特威 地理数据）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.04,0:32:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 出来了 哇 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.36,0:32:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh wow, that's what we did. - That's what we walked, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.36,0:32:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那就是我们测的 - 正是我们想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.72,0:32:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jacob the Dutch potato farmer was out in our fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.72,0:32:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}荷兰土豆农民雅各布 正在我们的田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.04,0:32:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}taking underground readings
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.04,0:32:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进行地下探测 这样我们 就能知道哪里的土壤肥沃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we'd know where the soil was good
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and where it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哪里贫瘠
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.44,0:32:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jacob can look down into the centre of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.44,0:32:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雅各布可以看透地心
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.92,0:32:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Like an echo sounder in a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.92,0:32:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 就像潜艇上的回声测深仪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.28,0:32:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Something like that, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.28,0:32:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多吧 对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.68,0:32:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As he'd explained in Holland,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.68,0:32:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正如他在荷兰解释的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:52.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}red denoted the rich areas of soil
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}红色代表肥沃的土壤区域 深蓝色代表贫瘠的区域
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and dark blue the weaker patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.20,0:32:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And with this information,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.20,0:33:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有了这些信息 我们现在就可以进行定点播种了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.96,0:33:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we could now do targeted seed planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.52,0:33:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we get the AgBot, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.52,0:33:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们启动农业机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.40,0:33:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we say, when you're going over this red bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.40,0:33:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后说：“当你经过这片红色区域时 像机关枪扫射一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}pummel the ground, you know, like machine-gun fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把种子撒下去”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.84,0:33:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you're going over this blue bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.84,0:33:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当你经过这片蓝色区域时 它就会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.88,0:33:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - It changes the rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Seed rate. - At which it's planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 播种的速率 - 播种速率 对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 如果… - 我已经给农业机器人做了一张地图
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.76,0:33:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I already made a map for the AgBot, so you could drill variable. I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.76,0:33:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样你就可以进行变量播种了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.04,0:33:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那张地图是我做的 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it wasn't just variable-rate seed planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且不仅仅是变量播种
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.56,0:33:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With this new information,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.56,0:33:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有了这些新信息 我们现在可以通过定点撒粪肥
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.04,0:33:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we could now fertilise the field more efficiently
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.56,0:33:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by doing targeted muck spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.56,0:33:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来更有效地给田地施肥
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as a bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外 我们还有一大堆 特别好的粪肥可以用
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had a mountain of rather special muck ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.68,0:33:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not cow muck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.68,0:33:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那不是牛粪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.88,0:33:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bet you can't guess what animal that came out of the back of.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.88,0:33:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我敢打赌你猜不出是什么动物拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.00,0:33:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'm afraid you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.00,0:33:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 恐怕你猜错了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.64,0:33:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It actually came out of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.64,0:33:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实是这些家伙拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They live about ten miles away from Diddly Squat
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们住在离迪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.16,0:34:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at a local tourist attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.16,0:34:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大约16公里远的一个当地旅游景点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.80,0:34:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.80,0:34:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（科茨沃尔德野生动物园花园入口）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.88,0:34:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Cotswold Wildlife Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.88,0:34:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们到了 科茨沃尔德野生动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.72,0:34:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And last year, Reggie the owner had said he'd be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.72,0:34:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去年 园主雷吉说 他很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for us to help ourselves to everything that came out of their bottoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我们把他们动物拉的 所有东西都拉走
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've always felt that this is quite special stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直觉得这东西很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.20,0:34:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because actually they got a very short stomach, rhinos,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.20,0:34:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为犀牛的胃很短
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and so it's very fibrous, it's full of nutritional material.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它们的粪便纤维含量很高 富含营养物质
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.52,0:34:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's much better than cow dung. - Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.52,0:34:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 比牛粪好多了… - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.08,0:34:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I think so because cow dung's had much more taken out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.08,0:34:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得是这样 因为牛粪里 大多数营养已经被吸收掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because of the second stomach and all the rest of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为牛有第二胃什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.08,0:34:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whereas this stuff is neat, it even smells quite wholesome and fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.08,0:34:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这东西处于“原始状态” 刚拉出来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.64,0:34:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when it comes out the first time round.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.64,0:34:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至闻起来都很自然、很新鲜 基本上可以直接用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.44,0:34:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just sort of ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.44,0:34:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're my new favourite person.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.44,0:34:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是我最喜欢的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whilst our trailers were being loaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的拖拉机正在装货
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we said goodbye to the donors
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们跟这些“捐赠者”道了别
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.40,0:34:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then there was a little surprise for Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.40,0:34:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后给卡莱布准备了一个小惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.60,0:34:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- See the baby camel there? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.60,0:34:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看到那边的小骆驼了吗？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.84,0:34:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The little six-week-old one? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.84,0:34:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那只六周大的？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.76,0:35:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just been talking to one of the people who work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.76,0:35:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟这里的一个工作人员聊了聊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.88,0:35:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what they've called it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.88,0:35:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你知道他们叫它什么吗？ - 不知道 叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, what? - Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have they actually? - Yeah, they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.64,0:35:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的假的？ - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.12,0:35:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause it's got... It's had one of your endless hairstyles, it's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.12,0:35:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它的…它有着你那 永远不停换的发型中的一款
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they said
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 他们说它看起来像卡莱布库珀 就给它取名叫卡莱布了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.48,0:35:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it looks like Kaleb Cooper and they named it Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.44,0:35:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's made my day! - You can see its stupid hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.44,0:35:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这可把我高兴坏了！ - 你看 你能看到它那傻乎乎的头毛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.36,0:35:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not stupid, it's great, look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.36,0:35:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不傻 很好看 你看它！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's, yeah... They named it after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们用你的名字给它命名了 - 卡莱布！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.44,0:35:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.04,0:35:30.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back in the present,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.04,0:35:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到现在 这些史前动物的粪便
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.28,0:35:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the dung from this prehistoric animal was about to be spread
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.28,0:35:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正准备用太空时代的技术撒到地里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.16,0:35:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}using space-age technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- When it goes over a red bit... - It'll put on...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 当它经过红色区域时… - 就会少撒…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.40,0:35:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Less.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.40,0:35:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 少撒 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.44,0:35:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When it goes over a blue bit, you're putting more on the blue bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.44,0:35:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后当它经过蓝色区域时
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.52,0:35:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就在蓝色区域多撒 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.52,0:35:48.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Technology blows my mind and I'm 26 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.52,0:35:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}科技让我这个26岁的人 都觉得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.36,0:35:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Imagine being a 60-year-old farmer sat here...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.36,0:35:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想象一下 一个60岁的农民坐在这儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.72,0:35:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, not you. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.72,0:35:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不是说你 但你…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.72,0:35:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Not you."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.72,0:35:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“不是你”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.60,0:35:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But you know what I mean? - No, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.60,0:35:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你明白我的意思吗？ - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.12,0:35:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is because we went over to Holland for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.12,0:35:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是因为我们去了一趟荷兰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.36,0:35:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - And now look where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.36,0:35:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 看看我们到了什么地步
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看我们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.80,0:36:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- If your yield goes through... - Through the roof, it's worth doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.80,0:36:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果你的产量能够…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果产量暴增 那就值得做 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.72,0:36:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All we needed now was for the technology to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.72,0:36:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在只需要让这项技术成功运作
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.36,0:36:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know now he's coming up to a very good bit of soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.36,0:36:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我知道了 它正接近一块非常好的土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.88,0:36:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so the amount coming out of the back should reduce dramatically,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.88,0:36:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以后面撒出来的量应该会大大减少
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.20,0:36:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it has done, look, it has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.20,0:36:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确实减少了 你看 确实减了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, hardly any. It's like a fine mist of faeces.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 几乎没撒什么 就像一层薄薄的粪雾
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeez, I think it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 我觉得这办法管用
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now look, it's getting thicker again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 现在又变多了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.12,0:36:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is honestly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.12,0:36:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 这太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.04,0:36:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On that corner, it went to 5 tonnes a hectare,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.04,0:36:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那个角落 它每公顷撒五吨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}now I'm on 45 tonnes a hectare.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我这块地方每公顷撒45吨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, you're impressed with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:53.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么 你被震撼到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常震撼
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.80,0:36:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, now is the time to really surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.80,0:36:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是时候让他真正大吃一惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.24,0:37:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While Kaleb carried on with his mathematical muck spreading...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.24,0:37:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在卡莱布继续计算撒的粪肥量时…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.56,0:37:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Band 25 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.56,0:37:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在是25吨
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.28,0:37:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went to fetch the AgBot so it could start cultivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.28,0:37:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我去把农业机器人开过来 这样它就可以开始耕地了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When these lights on the top go green,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当顶上的这些灯变成绿色时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.88,0:37:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the AgBot will know which field it's in and be ready to start work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.88,0:37:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业机器人就会知道它在哪块地里 并准备开始工作
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.20,0:37:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're green!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.20,0:37:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}变绿了！我干得不错！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.96,0:37:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have done a good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.44,0:37:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.44,0:37:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:38:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:38:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那他妈是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.20,0:38:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The AgBot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.20,0:38:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.60,0:38:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've made your tractor, 21st century with its new stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.60,0:38:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把你的拖拉机 弄成了二十一世纪的新玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.12,0:38:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the 24th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.12,0:38:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可是二十四世纪的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've mapped this field,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经测绘了这块地 那天我拿着标杆绕了一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.72,0:38:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went all the way round it the other day with a prong,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.08,0:38:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so it knows the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.08,0:38:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它认识这块地 我们把它送到起点
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.52,0:38:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we're gonna get it to its start point,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.24,0:38:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then go to the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.24,0:38:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我就去酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.24,0:38:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It drives itself? You can go? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.24,0:38:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它自动驾驶？你直接走人就行？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it will cultivate this field.
