Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.60,0:43:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另一项工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.16,0:43:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, it was a job I was dreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.16,0:43:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可惜的是 那是一项我害怕的工作…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because ever since David the butcher had shown me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为自从屠宰场老板大卫 给我看了我的猪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}what a small amount of meat my pigs were producing,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能产出多少肉之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.56,0:43:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd known there was only one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.56,0:43:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就知道只有一个选择了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.64,0:43:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love the pigs. I have absolutely...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.64,0:43:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢这些猪 我绝对…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.28,0:43:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just been delighted with every day I'm down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.28,0:43:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天去那儿我都很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.16,0:43:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They make my heart sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.16,0:43:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们让我心情愉快 我和它们在一起非常快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.92,0:43:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm so happy with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.36,0:43:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But we're running a business here. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.36,0:43:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但我们在经营生意 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.64,0:44:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they make no financial sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.64,0:44:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而它们在经济上完全划不来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.08,0:44:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And so, over the next few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.08,0:44:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 在接下来的几天里 我们就要和它们全部说再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd be saying goodbye to all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, weaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好 小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.68,0:44:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, they're going off anyway. They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.68,0:44:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 反正它们也要走了 是时候让它们…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.64,0:44:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's time for them to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续向前了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The difference this time though is that
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只不过这次的不同之处在于 再也不会有新的小猪来取代它们了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.80,0:44:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there'd be no new piglets to replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:45:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are all the Swizz and Clumsy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:45:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些都是斯威兹和克拉姆西的后代
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.04,0:45:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- These are the last of the boys. - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.04,0:45:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这些是最后一批公猪了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.00,0:45:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.00,0:45:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They had a good life, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们过得挺好的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.24,0:45:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, a not very long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.24,0:45:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 只不过命不算长
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.36,0:45:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was even harder to say goodbye to the next group
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.36,0:45:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}告别下一批就更难了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.84,0:45:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it included one of the mothers
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.84,0:45:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为其中有一头是三年前我们买的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.04,0:45:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from the first batch we'd bought three years earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.04,0:45:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一批猪里的母猪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.28,0:45:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, Surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.28,0:45:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.80,0:45:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was the first pig we had that gave birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.80,0:45:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我们养的第一头生猪崽的母猪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:45:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:45:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.44,0:46:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.40,0:46:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.24,0:46:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Remember, for the better good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.24,0:46:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}记住 这是为了更好的发展
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.36,0:46:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - For the better good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.36,0:46:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 是为了更好的发展
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.44,0:46:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's still fucking sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.44,0:46:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还是他妈的很伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.44,0:46:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All good?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.44,0:46:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, no, not really 'cause of poor old Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好 真的不好 因为可怜的惊喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.80,0:46:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As long as you cry once I've left, I'm not too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.80,0:46:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只要你等我走了再哭就行 我不太担心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.16,0:46:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not going to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.16,0:46:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.88,0:46:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.88,0:46:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.96,0:46:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, thanks, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.96,0:46:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 谢谢 杰斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.28,0:46:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No worries. - Take care of yourself. Safe travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.28,0:46:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 保重 一路平安 - 没事 谢谢 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.00,0:46:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thanks, Kaleb. - See you later, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.00,0:46:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再见 杰斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.36,0:46:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Finally, the day came to say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.36,0:46:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后 告别最后两头一开始养的母猪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.72,0:46:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to the last two original mothers:
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.08,0:46:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clumsy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.08,0:46:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉姆西和斯威兹的日子到了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.00,0:46:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and Swizz.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.04,0:46:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A lot of happy memories from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.04,0:46:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些猪给我们留下了很多美好的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.84,0:47:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.84,0:47:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The one bit of good news in this whole sad saga is that
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在这整件伤心事中 唯一的好消息是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.44,0:47:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}these two had at least been saved from the slaughterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.44,0:47:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这两头至少不用进屠宰场了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.24,0:47:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're going off to a farm where...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.24,0:47:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们要去一个农场… 那里就像一所学校 孩子们去了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.12,0:47:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like a school, so children go, and they go, "These are pigs."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.12,0:47:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会说：“这是猪”
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.20,0:47:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, girls, you'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.20,0:47:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 姑娘们 你们会喜欢的 - 所以它们会成为…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.80,0:47:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're going to have a...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're going to be headmistresses in a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会成为一所学校的女校长
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.68,0:47:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, well, they're going off to be exhibits in a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.68,0:47:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它们是要去一所学校当展览品
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.24,0:47:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you gonna keep their names? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.24,0:47:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们会保留它们的名字吗？ - 会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.52,0:47:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Clumsy and Swizz. - Clumsy and Swizz, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.52,0:47:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 克拉姆西和斯威兹？ - 克拉姆西和斯威兹
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.12,0:47:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're going to very good homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.12,0:47:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们要去好人家了 - 这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.20,0:47:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's the important thing, 'cause they're brilliant, these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.20,0:47:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这两头真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.44,0:47:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I couldn't really have handled it
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.44,0:47:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 如果它们被送去吃掉 我真的会受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.96,0:47:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if they'd gone off to be eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.96,0:47:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know they've had four batches of piglets, Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.96,0:47:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道它们生了 四窝小猪崽吧 丽莎？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.92,0:47:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how many they've had in total between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.92,0:47:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道它们俩一共生了多少头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道 - 四窝 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.32,0:47:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Four lots, yeah? 70 pigs have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.32,0:47:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯？ - 存活了70头小猪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.44,0:47:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 70? - 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.44,0:47:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 70头？ - 70头！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.12,0:47:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Good girls. - That's pretty good, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.12,0:47:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好姑娘！ - 这真的很厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.68,0:47:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.68,0:47:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看！来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.36,0:48:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are dealing with Clumsy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.36,0:48:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你领的这头是克拉姆西
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.24,0:48:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, well done, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.24,0:48:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干得好 丽莎 - 上去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.04,0:48:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's Swizz waiting, look, patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.04,0:48:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}斯威兹在那里等着 你看 很耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.92,0:48:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, Swizz.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.92,0:48:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 斯威兹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.24,0:48:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's a good pig? Who is a good pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.24,0:48:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁是乖猪猪？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who is a good pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁是乖猪猪？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.44,0:48:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.44,0:48:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.12,0:48:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Swizz.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.12,0:48:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 斯威兹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.60,0:48:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.80,0:48:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.80,0:48:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 来吧 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.08,0:48:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There we go. Here we go. - In you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.08,0:48:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 走了 - 进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.72,0:48:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.72,0:48:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 来吧 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.92,0:48:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.92,0:48:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Marc. Safe travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 马克 一路平安 - 没事 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, no worries. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢 - 谢谢 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.12,0:48:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Thank you. - Thank you, thanks a lot.
